_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b32c9ae7/uploads/origins/bc546c14-496c-42dd-a045-b5846649a475?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bf4895c8564868a1a7dfcd2a6adae456", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b32c9ae7/uploads/origins/bc546c14-496c-42dd-a045-b5846649a475?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bf4895c8564868a1a7dfcd2a6adae456, https://si.imgix.net/b32c9ae7/uploads/origins/bc546c14-496c-42dd-a045-b5846649a475?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1902036aae8fdc35b5f9c5640391ef64 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b32c9ae7/uploads/origins/bc546c14-496c-42dd-a045-b5846649a475?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5ffbb735175c0ae93ff26448c105ee15 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Owozora/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8ebaa2b/uploads/origins/3e1baf15-b9a8-4b62-823b-cab486521284?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cca23f919e42b7c6d1bbbf2e37639573", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8ebaa2b/uploads/origins/3e1baf15-b9a8-4b62-823b-cab486521284?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cca23f919e42b7c6d1bbbf2e37639573, https://si.imgix.net/d8ebaa2b/uploads/origins/3e1baf15-b9a8-4b62-823b-cab486521284?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b336cc36dab98a15a9f638edafb2b5eb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d8ebaa2b/uploads/origins/3e1baf15-b9a8-4b62-823b-cab486521284?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09a13a232149e98abf4d2acc9fe9ee4f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先生、こんにちは、\n\n先生のイラストが大好きです！私のocを描いていただけたらとても嬉しいです。\n\n私のocは、角と長い巻き毛のある人間ではない女の子です。彼女の存在は人間の痛みに基づいており、「痛み」という概念そのものであるとも言えます。テーマは「血と肉の花」「痛み」「心の虜」。自由に描いてください！また、服装はシンプルな方がいいなら、調整しても構いません。\n\n彼女の詳しい外見は添付のリンクにあります。\n\nこのリクエストを読んでいただき、本当にありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WvCC84lpiVWahpDmlE5elardOUwiE2Zt", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Owozora/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3333b9e8/uploads/origins/4cdf6fa9-0738-458b-86fb-3a7bd98e5424?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a109b69b6b0794d13b5b5bc9156debe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3333b9e8/uploads/origins/4cdf6fa9-0738-458b-86fb-3a7bd98e5424?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a109b69b6b0794d13b5b5bc9156debe, https://si.imgix.net/3333b9e8/uploads/origins/4cdf6fa9-0738-458b-86fb-3a7bd98e5424?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0827c91f06523767069999b0cc490d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3333b9e8/uploads/origins/4cdf6fa9-0738-458b-86fb-3a7bd98e5424?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0a40894fb4ccdf170242c2a6fbc6e1c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nCan you draw my Vtuber? She is a punk raccoon girl who lives in the sewers and gets up to really weird activity. Can you draw her laying down on a skateboard with the POV from above?\nhttps://postimg.cc/gallery/0vgYCJw", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Owozora/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2ae5a58e/uploads/origins/4406a699-6917-4938-8631-a82df59da8f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f566470aa64775b85f11b4df1959d