ive.google.com/drive/u/0/mobile/folders/1qCdgliGgG47haaRJVMEb47_lyZtcngXl?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Owozora/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/750bae27/uploads/origins/1794de1b-32b1-4279-80f1-dbc8abccfd92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9220e7fd5769c5e08d4b71c9f5825239", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/750bae27/uploads/origins/1794de1b-32b1-4279-80f1-dbc8abccfd92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9220e7fd5769c5e08d4b71c9f5825239, https://si.imgix.net/750bae27/uploads/origins/1794de1b-32b1-4279-80f1-dbc8abccfd92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd0206371765f9f8b7d0ec9063ff4818 2x, https://si.imgix.net/750bae27/uploads/origins/1794de1b-32b1-4279-80f1-dbc8abccfd92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b943270d078991b714aff60815b7902 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "連続のリクエストで失礼します。\nOwozora様のイラストで是非描いていただきたいマイキャラの衣装があり、リクエストさせてください。\n可能であれば、つま先まで見えるセクシーな感じにしていただけると嬉しいです。\nご検討、よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/2Yhu8Wj", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Owozora/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab27f8bc/uploads/origins/04488cd0-45bf-4384-b12e-f012acd974a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc8c3c9c17eaf0088a8dbbfbd411d86d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ab27f8bc/uploads/origins/04488cd0-45bf-4384-b12e-f012acd974a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc8c3c9c17eaf0088a8dbbfbd411d86d, https://si.imgix.net/ab27f8bc/uploads/origins/04488cd0-45bf-4384-b12e-f012acd974a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f9baacbe04b6b7a32741e6baf72d34a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ab27f8bc/uploads/origins/04488cd0-45bf-4384-b12e-f012acd974a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=